    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00318",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "可谁知往屋里扫视了一圈，女人不见了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "But when he swept his eyes around the room, the woman was gone.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00318",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "他吓了一跳。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "He was startled.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00318",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "让他莫名其妙兜的圈子已经太多了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "He had already been led through far too many bewildering circles.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00318",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "不，哪儿都没有莫名其妙的事。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "No, there was nothing bewildering anywhere.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00318",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "女人不是好好地在那儿吗？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Wasn't the woman right there after all?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00318",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "她正背朝这边，低着头站在池子边上的水缸旁。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "She was standing by the water jar beside the basin, her back turned this way and her head lowered.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
